<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.edge.cosigns ~ a quorum partial, read and cosigned by the next seat

`lares edge cosign (<partial-json> | --from <file>)` reads ONE partial and prints only what its verified bytes say, signing nothing, so a person reads whom the act sets aside first. `--act <act-cid>` names the act id that read printed; then this vessel's seats sign, and the act lands once it counts. Any other act id refuses.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ read · sign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`read` params=`from/partial.json ~ read the partial, signing nothing`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`sign` params=`from/partial.json act/<act-cid> ~ add this vessel's seats`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ partial · from · act · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`partial` params=`takes/json seat/1 as/<partial-json> ~ the partial, inline`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from` params=`takes/host-path ~ the partial, from a file`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`act` params=`takes/act-cid ~ the act id the read printed: sign and land`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the acting face, by persona index; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/seats ~ the seats this vessel holds sign once --act names the act read`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ unreadable · EdgeCosignError

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`unreadable` params=`cure/[[realm.edge.cosigns from/partial.json]] ~ the file reads nothing, or the input holds more than ONE JSON partial`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`EdgeCosignError` params=`~ the partial or the act id refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ read · landed · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`read` params=`exit/0 ~ what the partial sets aside; nothing signed`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 ~ the seats signed; the act counts and landed, or waits on more seats`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

