!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares edge cosign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares edge cosign]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

